56	    <h2><a href="#r1" data-track="result-1">Harbor Morning: tidal patterns of the north inlet</a></h2>
57	    <p>Field measurements across three seasons show the inlet flushing cycle is closer to eleven days than the fourteen previously modeled.</p>
